1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,050
Tap your table:

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:01,733
fist,

3
00:00:01,786 --> 00:00:02,469
edge,

4
00:00:02,469 --> 00:00:03,100
palm...

5
00:00:03,142 --> 00:00:04,300
now FAST!

6
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,350
Mixed them up?

7
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,533
Your hand's fine.

8
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,467
Your BRAKES aren't.

9
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,560
Go again.

10
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,633
Each shape has to

11
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:11,450
STOP

12
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,233
before the next one starts.

13
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,471
Miss one stop,

14
00:00:14,471 --> 00:00:15,301
and the old one

15
00:00:15,301 --> 00:00:16,567
sneaks back in.

16
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:17,630
Fist...

17
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:18,633
FIST!

18
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,619
Doctors use this exact test

19
00:00:20,619 --> 00:00:21,700
to check your brain.

20
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:22,967
Relax.

21
00:00:23,004 --> 00:00:24,167
In one study,

22
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,167
being smart didn't help.

23
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,460
Now do it...

24
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,970
BACKWARDS.

